From d694107dac2e73d323f6d8e29ddbae778cd00cac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeiroNext <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 23:09:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Clean exported menus and proxy class and inserted-group
 actions

Drops items with a custom widget, adds stand-ins for widget class actions.
Hooks gtk_widget_insert_action_group to keep inserted groups, so their
actions get stand-ins that follow the group and activate from its widget

Assisted-by: LLM Claude Opus 5.5
